    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d54">

                <pb facs="0137" n="71" xml:id="pg71"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.2131/253: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Whitehouse</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-12-01T14:00:00-05:00">December 1, 1934—2
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>66. Your 92, November 23. Trade Agreement Organization has about completed
                    consideration of changes in agreement to be proposed to Colombia. The proposed
                    changes will be incorporated in a memorandum to be transmitted to Colombian
                    Legation in Washington within the next few days. The substance of the proposed
                    changes will be sent to you by air mail immediately the note is despatched.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
